==Trivia==
*The name is a play on "{{Wp|Watt#Kilowatt|kilowatt}}", a unit of power, with the word "killer" included to imply its hostility.
*The "ground" in this area doesn't appear on the [[minimap]]; it is empty aside from the portal icon.

